#. module: eh_account_sepa_ct
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_sepa_ct.field_eh_sepa_originator__requested_execution_offset_days
msgid ""
"Days to add to the batch payment_date when computing ReqdExctnDt. 0 means "
"same-day. 1 means next business day; the export does not enforce business-"
"day arithmetic, set the offset to match your bank's processing rules."
msgstr ""
"在计算 ReqdExctnDt 时添加到批次 payment_date 的天数。0 表示当天。1 "
"表示下一个工作日；导出不强制执行工作日运算，请设置偏移量以匹配您银行的处理规则。"

